    "detailed_description": "This is a cartoon style top view shooting game that supports single or local multiplayer gameplay, while also incorporating innovative construction and strategic elements. Players can use weapons with diverse styles, such as rebound guns or chainsaws, to fight against a large number of monsters with strange behaviors. They can withstand the fierce attacks of monster waves one after another, and it is crucial to build a variety of strange mechanisms and traps in advance. The tacit cooperation of two people can improve your construction efficiency. After defeating several insidious and powerful bosses, you will head to Nibelungen, where everything is hidden",
